            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oral argument was held on Tuesday, January 13, 2009 at 10:14 a.m."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ab7435d6fc68ceb88cf64359f87b909d54dd040bc28cb141c76d820877092931",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ab7435d6fc68-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether Michigan v. Jackson is immune from being reexamined at this point."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ab7435d6fc68ceb88cf64359f87b909d54dd040bc28cb141c76d820877092931",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ab7435d6fc68-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia questioned the rationale of Jackson, asking if a confession is deemed coerced simply because the defendant expressed a desire for counsel."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ab7435d6fc68ceb88cf64359f87b909d54dd040bc28cb141c76d820877092931",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ab7435d6fc68-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether the petitioner had an opportunity to make a request at the so\u2011called 72\u2011hour hearing."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ab7435d6fc68ceb88cf64359f87b909d54dd040bc28cb141c76d820877092931",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ab7435d6fc68-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter asked whether a request from the defendant is required to trigger Jackson, or if the rule can apply without an explicit request."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ab7435d6fc68ceb88cf64359f87b909d54dd040bc28cb141c76d820877092931",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ab7435d6fc68-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens noted that if the petitioner had made a request at the 72\u2011hour hearing, the outcome of the case would have been different."
      }
    ],
